#. Description of the plugin/theme
#: inc/Admin/Options.php:83 inc/Services/Previous.php:99
msgid "Get notifications on Slack when changes are made on your WP website."
msgstr "Ontvang meldingen op Slack wanneer er wijzigingen worden aangebracht op uw WordPress-website."

